...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

team: 팀 리더 (Team) { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI gpt-4o { class: ext }
web: Web Agent { class: ours }

team -> openai: 앞선 위임 호출 · 재무 보고서\n(tool 메시지)
openai -> team: delegate_task_to_member(\nweb-agent, task)
team -> web: task 문자열
web -> openai: 역할 · task\n+ 도구 스키마 둘
openai -> web: web_search(\n"AAPL latest news")
